   132	- KPI-threshold identification for diagnostic screening and performance testing is named as a departmental operating principle, but no specific RTP criteria, battery, or phased-return protocol appears anywhere in this corpus. **Explicit (principle) / gap (no criteria stated)** [baylor-applied-performance-playbook.md p.6] Update: a written protocol exists outside the corpus. Eric (interview 2026-09-28, Q4, Q4a): "There is a written protocol", namely the Baylor UE Rehab Program Template and the Baylor LE Rehab Program Template (both .docx, currently in Eric's Downloads folder). **Explicit (interview 2026-09-28, Q4a)** Not yet staged, so Flint does not know their content; staging a text copy is the next step.
